Third-Party Notices
===================

DebridMovieMapper includes the third-party crates listed below, under the licences shown. The
list covers every crate compiled for the release image's targets (x86_64-unknown-linux-musl and
aarch64-unknown-linux-musl), normal and build dependencies but not dev-dependencies.

Where a crate offers a choice of licences, it is used under the first of them in about.toml's
`accepted` list, and only that licence's text is reproduced. Each text below is the crate's own
licence file, with its copyright lines, when cargo-about recognises one in the crate. Otherwise it
is the standard SPDX text, preceded by the authors the crate's Cargo.toml names.

This file is generated by cargo-about from about.toml and about.hbs. Regenerate it whenever
Cargo.lock changes instead of editing it by hand:

    cargo about generate --offline --locked -o THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES about.hbs

